    Uses the AST to restrict evaluation to arithmetic operators only, so it
    cannot execute arbitrary code (unlike ``eval``). Returns the string form
    of the result, or ``None`` if the expression is not a safe arithmetic
    expression.

    Args:
        expression: The arithmetic expression to evaluate.

    Returns:
        The evaluated result as a string, or None if unsafe/invalid.
    \"\"\"
